  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ForumCiv: Innovation for Future Civil Society in Belarus 2019-2023 - Innovation for Future Civil Society in Belarus 2022-2023, new strategy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ForumCiv: Innovation for Future Civil Society in Belarus 2019-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forum Syd har ans&#xf6;kt om en insats g&#xe4;llande 38 miljoner SEK f&#xf6;r att utf&#xf6;ra projektet &quot;Innovation for Future Civil Society in Belarus&quot; i Belarus &#xf6;ver tidsperioden 2019-2023. 

Insatsens avsikt &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja Belarusiska demokratiska civilsamh&#xe4;llesakt&#xf6;rer genom: 
1) St&#xf6;dja nuvarande civilsamh&#xe4;llesorganisationer som kan ing&#xe5; policydialog med myndigheter; 
2) st&#xe4;rka civila grupper i regionerna i deras direkta svar mot r&#xe4;ttighetskr&#xe4;nkningar; och
3) fr&#xe4;mja nya gr&#xe4;srotsorganisationer och bygga l&#xe4;nkar emellan dem.

Insatsens generella avsedda resultat &#xe4;r att: 

&quot;Milj&#xf6;r&#xf6;relsen i Belarus &#xe4;r st&#xe4;rkt f&#xf6;r att tillsammans med myndigheter engagera sig i policydiskussioner r&#xf6;rande klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar, biologisk m&#xe5;ngfald och tillg&#xe5;ng till milj&#xf6;r&#xe4;ttigheter&quot;

&quot;Den tematiska och strategiska kapaciteten inom j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsr&#xf6;relsen i Belarus &#xe4;r st&#xe4;rkt och ut&#xf6;kad&quot;
 
och,

&#x201c;Civilsamh&#xe4;llet i Belarus anv&#xe4;nder nya och innovativa teknologier&#x201d;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forum Syd has applied to Sida for funding of 38 million SEK to carry out the project &quot;Innovation for Future Civil Society in Belarus&quot; in Belarus during the period 2019-2023.

The intervention&apos;s objectives are to supportin Belarusian democratic civil society organizations by 1) supporting current civil society organizations that can engage in policy dialogue with authorities ; 2) strengthening civic groups in the regions in their immediate response to rights violations; and 3) fostering new grass-root civic groups and building links between them. 

Broadly speaking, Forum Syd intends to reach the following results; 1)&#x201c;Environmental movement in Belarus is strengthen to engage with authorities in policy discussions on climate change, bio diversity and access to environmental justice&#x201d;, 2) &#x201c;The thematic and strategic capacities within the gender equality movement in Belarus are strengthened and expanded&#x201d; and 3) &#x201c;Civil society in Belarus is using new and innovative technologies&#x201d;.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall Objective:
Belarusians can and do exercise basic rights and are taking actions that result in a democratic influence over the policies and the decisions of the state.

Expected programme results/The progamme pupose:

Belarusian civil society maintains its relevance and influence on processes in the country by raising awareness of social and political issues and maintaining and increasing its social capital on the ground in Belarus.

Outcome-level result:

- Civil society organisations, initiatives and activists synchronise their agendas to have a consistent approach towards social and political processes

- Belarusian civil society continues to influence social and political processes in Belarus, by creating and offering to the rights-holders an alternative, fact-based narrative of the ongoing developments in the country.

-Belarusian rights-holders have enough knowledge and skill and have built a network of likeminded peers, to become active participants in the social and political processes in their country.</narrative>
  </description>
